Hi, Calvin,

Thanks for the update. The change looks good to me. Some minor comments.

For retry timeout, our convention is to use retry.backoff.max.ms and
retry.backoff.ms. So, to be consistent, the new configurations should be
add.partitions.to.txn.retry.backoff.max.ms and
add.partitions.to.txn.retry.backoff.ms.

Also, could you specify the defaults for these two values?

Thanks,

Jun




