Hi Jun,
Thanks for the feedback, will update the name as suggested.
The default values are
add.partitions.to.txn.retry.backoff.ms=3D20
-- This is because the client side AddPartitionsToTxn retry backoff is 20ms=
.
add.partitions.to.txn.retry.backoff.max.ms=3D100
-- We want this value to be small to avoid client side timeout and retry,
but also long enough for the markers to propagate.


