Hello,
I'd like to initiate a vote on KIP-1124, which aims to provide a clear
upgrade path for Kafka clients. This proposal will not only help users
transition smoothly but also reduce the development effort required to
support upgrades.

Discuss Thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/v7by71w1cmn4z4qpw0kkw4ycrpxddh9n
KIP:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1124%3A+Providing+a+clear+Kafka+Client+upgrade+path
JIRA:
https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18422

Best,
Kuan-Po

