ng
> > the
> > > CONCURRENT_TRANSACTION error. This error is common after the
> transaction
> > is
> > > committed but before the markers are fully propagated to all the
> involved
> > > partitions. With the server side retry, the client can avoid the
> frequent
> > > and expensive retry for the produce request. In order to better contr=
ol
