FYI, your votes are not binding if you are not a committer for the Apache
Kafka project.
Please see here
<https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Bylaws#Bylaws-Voting> fo=
r
more details.
You can vote with "+1 (non-binding)".
Although it doesn't have the same effect as a binding vote, expressing your
ideas by voting is still great. =F0=9F=98=80

