Sanskar Jhajharia created KAFKA-18811:
-----------------------------------------

             Summary: Allow passing the Consumer Configs to the AdminClient=
Properties for VerifiableShareConsumers
                 Key: KAFKA-18811
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18811
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Sub-task
            Reporter: Sanskar Jhajharia
            Assignee: Chirag Wadhwa


The VerifiableShareConsumer currently allows the users to specify the {{{}-=
-offset-reset-strategy{}}}. When the same boots up, it makes an AdminClient=
 Call to alter the config for this specific group. However, when it generat=
ed the AdminClient Properties for the same, it doesn't take into account th=
e configs passed in through the {{--consumer.config}} property.=C2=A0



