Hi Greg:

I see you are from a very practical point of view to evaluate this KIP=2E =
With tiered storage already merged in it is hard to accept another improvem=
ent that provide similar solution, even it is better by design and enable p=
otential future growth=2E
That being said=2E This is still a community project and the vote is alrea=
dy open=2E So let the community decide what is the way=2E
Thank you for your efforts to review this KIP=2E

De Gao

