ption`. Transaction producer can throw both `TimeoutException` or `Transact=
ionAbortableException`.
>  * Applications using should handle TimeoutException from transaction pro=
ducer as abortable because it=E2=80=99s not safe to retry the produce. Retr=
ying would assign new sequence numbers to the messages, and if the original=
 message had actually succeeded, the new messages would become duplicates, =
breaking exactly-once semantics. Details: [https://lists.apache.org/thread/=
ox2dm8n9hpzwj0qo53ssm3ncl8f7cjso]=C2=A0



