Matthias J. Sax created KAFKA-18836:
---------------------------------------

             Summary: Make ConsumerGroupMetadata an interface
                 Key: KAFKA-18836
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18836
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: clients, consumer
            Reporter: Matthias J. Sax


This ticket is based on feedback from the user mailing list: [https://lists.apache.org/thread/bw0ycbmtxlrfd3bsh9kk41xjdq9dhmnz]

Users should not create instances of `ConsumerGroupMetadata`, and this class should not have any public constructor.

Ideally, it would only be an interface. We should do a KIP an deprecate both constructors, and make it an interface in AK 5.0 release.



