Hey all,

I would like to discuss a proposal regarding the JAAS-related processes.
After some consideration, I believe we should adopt the approach of using
an =E2=80=9Callow-list=E2=80=9D to filter modules, rather than relying on a=
 =E2=80=9Cdisallow-list.=E2=80=9D

Although this KIP is simple, I believe it offers significant value in terms
of both security and efficiency. By focusing on what is allowed rather than
what is denied, we can better control and ensure trusted modules are the
only ones in use.

Thanks!

