A. Sophie Blee-Goldman created KAFKA-18839:
----------------------------------------------

             Summary: Drop support for eager rebalancing in Streams
                 Key: KAFKA-18839
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18839
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams
            Reporter: A. Sophie Blee-Goldman
            Assignee: A. Sophie Blee-Goldman
             Fix For: 4.0.0


In 3.1 we deprecated the EAGER protocol in Kafka Streams (see KAFKA-13439).=
 This ticket covers actually dropping this protocol in 4.0.

=C2=A0

Note that KAFKA-8575 covers the actual task cleanup we can do once we no lo=
nger have to support eager rebalancing, which can now be done any time afte=
r 4.0



