Nothing is "wrong with it" -- it's a little esoteric and very tied to
the Spotless tool as custom written software.
(https://github.com/diffplug/spotless/blob/main/lib/src/main/java/com/diffp=
lug/spotless/java/ImportSorter.java)

My discussion is centered around eventual migration to probably
tree-wide formatting which a good first step is adopting import
sorting from a Java formatter (in this case google-java-format).

