Chia-Ping Tsai created KAFKA-18853:
--------------------------------------

             Summary: encourage users to use LogLevelConfig to configure dynamic logger level
                 Key: KAFKA-18853
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18853
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


