Content-Transfer-Encoding: quoted-printable
X-JIRA-FingerPrint: 30527f35849b9dde25b450d4833f0394

Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio created KAFKA-18865:
--------------------------------------------------

             Summary: Improve KRaft handling of kraft.version
                 Key: KAFKA-18865
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-18865
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: kraft
            Reporter: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio
            Assignee: Jos=C3=A9 Armando Garc=C3=ADa Sancio


Handling of kraft.version is a bit tricky.

The kraft.version that is exposed by the kraft client is potentially an unc=
ommitted value.

In some cases kraft is interested in the latest value (irrespective of comm=
itted vs uncommitted) but in some case kraft should use the latest commit v=
alue.

For example, kraft should use the latest committed value when exposing it o=
utside of the kraft client and when determining which version of quorum-sta=
te to serialize and persist. But KRaft should use the latest value (irrespe=
ctive of committed vs uncommitted) when determining which control version t=
o persist to the log itself.



