Hi Giri,

The first question I would ask is: what happens when you run the produce=
r with the default configuration? Producer timeouts are usually caused b=
y client misconfiguration, network issues, broker load/topology changes,=
 or a combination of those.

Try to remove as many configuration overrides as reasonably possible on =
the client and see if the issue still persists.

Thanks,
Kirk

